<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed</p>
<p>all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM    MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>2.092  bln pesos  7 days  30.02  29.70   29.77    4    4</p>
<p>2.093  bln pesos  6 days  29.78  29.62   29.78    2    2</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  5 days  29.67  29.63   29.65    3    3</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  2 days  29.65  29.26   29.46    4    3</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
